Z||000003||Jaei Sun||07-13-2001||04:55 PM||||I have it too in the sunroof (creaks).  I want to take my roof piece off and reinforce from below like mad with fiber glass around the sunroof opening on the roof SMC. The creking happens like going up onto the lawn over the "curb", or very bumpy roads... <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/trans_fiero_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
