Z||000013||ChadMan||07-18-2001||04:24 PM||||I only notice it in the winter, if I get ice under my roof panels.  Then it creaks and cracks if I enter or exit a driveway at an angle.<P>I'm surprised Sage hasn't weighed in on this topic.  He lives on a hillside and the factory 1/4 windows on his GT cracked when he turned into his steep driveway.||||reg||1
